SCOPE AND ONE EXPLICIT CARVE-OUT
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This licence covers the whole of this repository: the harness, the audit
tool, the item bank, the statistical self-tests, the analysis, the prose,
and the data files we produced.

ONE SUBSET IS EXTERNALLY LICENSED AND REMAINS SO REGARDLESS OF THIS FILE:

    data/frontier-scores.json

1,685 of its 1,711 records are derived from the Epoch AI public benchmark
dataset, which Epoch AI publishes under CC BY 4.0 and which requires that
the source and the authors be credited. Those records remain under
Epoch AI's CC BY 4.0 terms and attribution obligations. Redistributing
this file under a different or more permissive licence does not alter that,
and does not discharge the attribution requirement.

The remaining records in that file come from other first-party sources,
each under its own terms, enumerated with retrieval dates in
data/ATTRIBUTION.md.

data/benchmarks.json and data/metrics.json describe benchmarks and metrics
designed by other people. Their definitions are quoted from the primary
papers and official documentation, with URLs; the underlying benchmark works
are the property of their authors and are cited, not relicensed.

The raw run logs under reports/round1/ are measurements of a model's output
and are covered by this licence. The model names appearing in them are
trademarks of their respective owners and are used nominatively, to identify
what was measured.

=======================================================================

CITATION
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

See CITATION.cff. If you reuse data/frontier-scores.json, cite Epoch AI
as well — see data/ATTRIBUTION.md for the required credit string.

=======================================================================

HOW TO SATISFY ATTRIBUTION
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

State that you used this work, name the authors of the underlying dataset
where applicable, link to the licence, and indicate whether you made changes.
For Epoch AI-derived records, reproduce the credit recorded in
data/ATTRIBUTION.md verbatim.
